<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Site-Reliability on All about Raspberry Pi</title><link>https://hugozhu.site/tags/site-reliability/</link><description>Recent content in Site-Reliability on All about Raspberry Pi</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hugozhu.site/tags/site-reliability/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>谁停掉了数字员工的早读？</title><link>https://hugozhu.site/post/2026/390-who-stopped-the-morning-reading/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hugozhu.site/post/2026/390-who-stopped-the-morning-reading/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;我的钉钉数字员工每个月偶尔会抽下风：「⚠️ 暂时无法处理你的消息，请稍后再试。」，往往重启一下就好了。今天我让 opencode + GLM-5.3 排查了下这个问题。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;十五分钟后，它把案子破了。凶手很狡猾：藏在三份完美证词背后，还顺走了我的 &lt;code&gt;/etc/hosts&lt;/code&gt; 当人质。&lt;/p&gt;
